Unreleased
==========

* New make release target: distcheck plus a .sha256 checksum file for
  each release archive.
* New fktoupper and fktolower: in-place, ASCII-only case conversion.

fkstring 0.9.0 (2026-09-24)
===========================

First versioned release. The API is feature-rich but not yet frozen:
until 1.0.0, minor releases may change it incompatibly.

* Construction and destruction: fkstrnew, fkstrnewb, fkalloc, fkcalloc,
  fkstrdup, fkstrdestroy, fkarraydestroy.
* Editing: fkstrcat, fkstrcatc, fkstrcatone, fkinsert, fkinsertc,
  fkreplace, fkreplacec, fkstrtrunc, fkremove, fkltrim, fkrtrim, fktrim.
* Capacity control: fkslack, fkfit.
* Deriving strings: fksubstr, fksplit, fkjoin.
* Formatting: fksprintf, fkvsprintf, fkstrcatf, fkstrcatvf.
* Comparison and search: fkstrcmp, fkstrcasecmp, fkstreq, fkstrfind,
  fkstrfindc, fkstrchr, fkstrrchr, fkstartswith(c), fkendswith(c).
* I/O: fkstrwrite, fkstrread, fkreadline, fkslurp, fkslurpfile, fkcatfd,
  fkcatf, fkcat.
* Versioning: fkstrversion and the FKSTRING_VERSION* macros.
* Autotools build, test suite (make check, make memcheck) and man pages
  for the whole public API.
